{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"The gulls circle overhead, their cries sharp and desperate against the grey backdrop of the sea. I have spent the last two days walking the shingle beach, letting the cold bite into my fingers, trying to shake off the lethargy that clinging has kept me under for months. The house here is small and Drafty, but the solitude is a balm I did not know I needed. I keep finding myself thinking about your garden, about the way the light caught the rose petals last autumn. It seems a lifetime ago now. I would love to hear from you, not to discuss the past or the complications of our present, but simply to know that you are safe and that the spring is warming in your corner of the world. I remain, with fond regard, Elise.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792461025,"id":"chatcmpl-18e019ce2e149560006e","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,24